When the user asks to compare, reconcile, or find deltas between a Guesty guest folio and Advanced Deposit:

1. Run `npm run reconcile -- --confirmation <CODE>` (or `--reservation-id`).
2. Present the report highlights and delta amount clearly.
3. Do not invent totals — use CLI output only.
4. Do not post payments or journal entries; report only.

Demo account cleanup (cancel junk reservations / sanitize guests) is a separate skill: `.cursor/skills/guesty-demo-cleanup`. Do not run cleanup writes during folio reconcile.
